Package: MetVAE
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Correlation Networks for Untargeted Metabolomics Data with a
    Variational Autoencoder
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-11-20
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Huang", family = "Lin",
        email = "huanglinfrederick@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4892-7871"))
Description: Estimates a sparse correlation network among metabolites from
    untargeted metabolomics abundance data. Zeros are treated as values
    below the detection limit and are imputed by a variational autoencoder,
    measured covariates are removed on the centered log-ratio scale, and the
    correlation estimate is sparsified either by Fisher z-tests with a
    multiplicity correction or by the sparse estimation of correlation (SEC)
    estimator with a cross-validated penalty. Results can be exported as
    GraphML networks.
